      "text": "{\"question\": \"How many years of experience does Joe Wilson mention in his professional summary?\",\n\n\"expected_answer\": \"Joe Wilson mentions 6.5+ years of experience.\", \n\n\"actual_answer\": \"The PDF does not provide enough information to answer the question. The\nprofessional summary for Joe Wilson lists his roles (Generative AI Engineer | NLP | Computer\nVision | Machine Learning) but does not mention a specific number of years of experience.\", \n\n\"context\": \"PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\\n\\nJOE WILSON \\nGenerative AI Engineer | NLP|\nComputer Vision| Machine Learning\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\"}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "xYSG_oJ9Acu6MlqZZRZgM",
      "originalText": "{\"question\": \"How many years of experience does Joe Wilson mention in his professional summary?\", \n\n\"expected_answer\": \"Joe Wilson mentions 6.5+ years of experience.\", \n\n\"actual_answer\": \"The PDF does not provide enough information to answer the question. The professional summary for Joe Wilson lists his roles (Generative AI Engineer | NLP | Computer Vision | Machine Learning) but does not mention a specific number of years of experience.\", \n\n\"context\": \"PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\\n\\nJOE WILSON \\nGenerative AI Engineer | NLP| Computer Vision| Machine Learning\\n\\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\"}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
